    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to believe that. seeing how it played out with my dad and my brother... it feels like a script. even when i try to be different, i just end up falling back into the same patterns. it feels like the more i struggle, the more i just drag everyone else down with me. like, if i actually managed to stop the cycle, wouldn't it be easier if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore?",
